              "value": [
                {
                  "dsDescriptionValue": {
                    "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                    "multiple": false,
                    "typeClass": "primitive",
                    "value": "A dataset of labeled requests assembled from several public datasets, namely, Malicious-URLs, PKDD, and CSIC 2010 (also included).\n\nTo merge the datasets, only the URI of each web request was used. To construct a feature vector to train the networks, each URI was tokenized in unigrams following a bag-of-words approach.\n\nFor each URI, the values of the unigrams were computed using term frequency\u2013inverse document frequency (TF\u2013IDF). Each URI was represented by an l1-normalized vector composed of the 500 most frequent tokens across the entire dataset."
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
